    @section natsstoragetypes Storage Types

    |!Constant|!Value|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_STORAGE_FILE|0|File-based storage
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_STORAGE_MEMORY|1|Memory-based storage

    @section natsdiscardpolicies Discard Policies

    |!Constant|!Value|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DISCARD_OLD|0|Discard old messages when full
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DISCARD_NEW|1|Reject new messages when full

    @section natsackpolicies Ack Policies

    |!Constant|!Value|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_ACK_NONE|0|No acknowledgment required
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_ACK_ALL|1|All messages must be acknowledged
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_ACK_EXPLICIT|2|Each message acknowledged individually

    @section natsdeliverpolicies Deliver Policies

    |!Constant|!Value|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DELIVER_ALL|0|Deliver all available messages
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DELIVER_LAST|1|Start with the last message
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DELIVER_NEW|2|Deliver only new messages
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DELIVER_BY_START_SEQUENCE|3|Start from a specific sequence
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DELIVER_BY_START_TIME|4|Start from a specific time
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_DELIVER_LAST_PER_SUBJECT|5|Last message per subject

    @section natsreplaypolicies Replay Policies

    |!Constant|!Value|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_REPLAY_INSTANT|0|Replay as fast as possible
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_REPLAY_ORIGINAL|1|Replay at original delivery rate

    @section natskvoperations Key-Value Operations

    |!Constant|!Value|!Description
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_KV_OP_PUT|1|Put or update operation
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_KV_OP_DELETE|2|Delete operation
    |@ref Qore::Nats::NATS_KV_OP_PURGE|3|Purge operation
